e.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"71ZXZF57G88","slug":"163","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-163-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #163 w/ Little Simz","artwork":"/images/episodes/163.jpg","content":"Little Sims joins Joe Kay with an exclusive Soulection mix.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11016,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":2}},{"id":"jZqBXrdetC8","position":40,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Amy Winehouse - In My Bed","track":{"id":"ofIHpv_Bke8","path":"/artists/amy-winehouse/tracks/in-my-bed/","slug":"in-my-bed","title":"In My Bed","artist":{"slug":"amy-winehouse","title":"Amy Winehouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/amy-winehouse/tracks/in-my-bed.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"MUTAwmt5Mm0","slug":"173","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-173"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #173","artwork":"/images/episodes/173.jpg","content":"Joe Kay makes it to the studio in time to throw down an unforgettable set full of primarily forgotten classics that will have you reminiscing on life.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAs if this news isn't enough, we just hit 100K here on Soundcloud this past Friday literally while we launched our new residency @ the legendary Echoplex! Talk about timing and accomplishments. THANK you to each and every one of you for supporting us and spreading this sound to everyone. We plan to give you something really soon to celebrate 100K supporters worldwide and more. Big ups to the 900+ people who showed up to The Sound of Tomorrow this past Friday. Very inspiring.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10836,"location":"US","published_a